  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "Changing `EncVampire02Template` 03384E also needs `EncVampire02TemplateBoss` 02E098 (Master Vampire, level 14; on *Vampire Boss*): it uses 03384E as its template but not for `Stats`.",
      "Changing `EncVampire03Template` 03384F also needs `EncVampire03TemplateBoss` 02E12A (level 23; on *Vampire Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing `EncVampire04Template` 033850 also needs `EncVampire04TemplateBoss` 02E1B1 (level 31; on *Vampire Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing `EncVampire05Template` 033851 also needs `EncVampire05TemplateBoss` 02E1B8 (level 42; on *Vampire Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing `EncVampire06Template` 033852 also needs `EncVampire06TemplateBoss` 02E1BF (level 53; on *Vampire Boss*): same pattern.",
      "Changing `DLC1EncVampire07Template` 00282A:Dawnguard.esm also needs `DLC1EncVampire07TemplateBoss` 00282B:Dawnguard.esm (level 65; on *Vampire Boss*): same pattern.",
      "The rung templates `EncVampire01Template`–`06` and `DLC1EncVampire07Template` use `EncVampire00Template` 032FE7 as their template without `Stats`: changing the Fledgling changes none of them.",
      "Each rung is a template plus female race variants that inherit its level: five vanilla (`EncVampire0NBretonF`/`DarkElfF`/`HighElfF`/`ImperialF`/`NordF`) and three Dawnguard (`DLC1EncVampire0NBretonF`/`DarkElfF`/`NordF`); the Nightlord has five plus three `…Alt`.",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Hern, Hert and Sybille Stentor, vampires with no template, are on *Unique Vampires*.",
      "Every other vampire record (the female race variants of each rung, the `TreasCorpseVampire*` corpses, the Bloodchill CC copies, the Vampire Naturalist (on *Unique Vampires*) and every `Lvl*Vampire*` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
